WEBVTT

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:02.279
I think he would have said,
"I don't need this."

00:14:02.882 --> 00:14:04.032
But ...

00:14:04.056 --> 00:14:05.064
(Laughter)

00:14:05.088 --> 00:14:06.446
How should we honor Feynman?

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.152
How should we really honor Feynman?

00:14:08.176 --> 00:14:11.320
I think the answer
is we should honor Feynman

00:14:11.344 --> 00:14:15.306
by getting as much baloney
out of our own sandwiches

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.576
as we can.

00:14:16.941 --> 00:14:18.092
Thank you.

00:14:18.116 --> 00:14:21.317
(Applause)